<section-cards webc:nokeep :@cards="homeCards" class="breakout"></section-cards>

<div class="ui-card ui-outlined color-outline breakout">
  <hgroup>
    <h3>VILLAGE HALL NEWS</h3>
    <p>What a year it has been for the hall committee! New walls, windows and
      doors (and soon a new roof) outside and inside new curtains, chairs and
      crockery, much paid for through successfully applied for grants. All
      that's needed now are some new people to join the committee to help take
      all the good work forward. We meet about four times a year and run a few
      fund-raising events to keep the hall coffers in good shape. Please
      consider joining us, we're friendly, open to new ideas and would be
      delighted to see you!
      <div class="home-cta-text-footer">
        For more information please contact Ann (
        <a href="mailto: volunteers@westmuir.org.uk"
          >volunteers&#64;westmuir.org.uk </a
        >) or join us at the AGM on 16th June, at 7.30pm. Thanks!
      </div>
    </p>
  </hgroup>
</div>

<h2 class="main-heading">Latest</h2>

